g"><h1 class="text-inherit mb-4 text-2xl/tight font-bold lg:text-3xl/[115%]">CPR Bra</h1><div data-contentful-field-id="text" class="text-base/[22px] font-normal lg:text-lg/6 [&amp;_a]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:hover]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:active]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:focus-visible]:text-inherit!"><div class="rich-text-content [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><p class="mb-4 last:mb-0">One in three people are afraid to give CPR to a woman in public because they are worried about touching breasts.</p></div></div><div data-contentful-field-id="links" class="mt-6 flex gap-4 justify-start items-center flex-wrap flex-row"><a data-contentful-entry-id="2T134eOdFn0UajFnE2z2CR" href="https://www.sja.org.uk/cpr-bra/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 focus-visible:bg-secondary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary focus-visible:text-contrast-five focus-visible:outline-offset-0 font-bold text-contrast-five tracking-wide font-body disabled:!bg-contrast-three disabled:!outline-none border-2 has-[svg]:h-auto transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform] motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-out motion-safe:[transform:translateZ(0)] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [backface-visibility:hidden] motion-reduce:transform-none cursor-pointer disabled:!border-contrast-three border-white bg-contrast-one rounded-[360px] hover:bg-off-white hover:border-off-white focus:border-primary [&amp;_svg,&amp;_img]:-order-1 h-12 px-3 text-base [&amp;_svg]:!size-6 has-[svg]:min-h-12 motion-safe:hover:scale-[1.05] motion-safe:focus-visible:scale-[1.05] motion-safe:active:scale-[1.02]"><span class="shrink-0 no-underline"><svg class="" style="color:currentColor" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9.32188 7.99988L4.09688 2.55926C3.96563 2.42488 3.96876 2.20301 4.10313 2.06551L5.03751 1.10926C5.17188 0.971759 5.39063 0.968634 5.52188 1.10301L11.9031 7.74988C11.9719 7.81863 12.0031 7.91238 11.9969 8.00301C12 8.09676 11.9688 8.18738 11.9031 8.25613L5.52188 14.8999C5.39063 15.0343 5.17188 15.0311 5.03751 14.8936L4.10313 13.9374C3.96876 13.7999 3.96563 13.578 4.09688 13.4436L9.32188 7.99988Z" fill="#020202"></path></svg></span><span class="">Help bust the taboo</span></a></div></div><div class="w-full"><div class="relative h-auto md:h-full md:aspect-[16/9] object-cover w-screen max-w-none md:-ml-[calc((100dvw-100%)/2)] overflow-hidden"><picture class="block h-full w-full"><source srcSet="https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=128&amp;h=160&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 128w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=256&amp;h=320&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 256w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=384&amp;h=480&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 384w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=640&amp;h=800&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 640w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=750&amp;h=938&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 750w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=828&amp;h=1035&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 828w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-bra.JPG?w=1080&amp;h=1350&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center&amp;q=80&amp;fm=webp 1080w, https://images.eu.ctfassets.net/e2agrqk9adjs/6RlFx89MTSe4RZD7fKLtaa/0d007096b021c7556cd77888f4735e65/nikki-sanderson-cpr-b