ull object-cover"/></picture></div></div></section></div><div><div class="section-component px-4 lg:px-10 py-6 bg-soft-green-tint text-contrast-five rounded-lg" data-contentful-entry-id="VZqrTEXqFWeUZSUFh19E0"><div class="content-wrapper rounded-lg w-full text-left"><div class="relative mb-4 lg:mb-6"><h2 class="text-lg/[115%] lg:text-2xl/[115%] tracking-[0.36px] font-bold text-inherit" data-contentful-field-id="heading">Are you looking for our courses and supplies services?</h2></div><div data-contentful-field-id="content" class="prose max-w-none leading-5.5"><div class="rich-text-content [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><p class="mb-4 last:mb-0">We&#x27;ve moved our first aid courses and supplies to a new website to improve your experience. Don&#x27;t worry, <!-- -->you can still book and order everything you need from our full range<!-- -->. Visit the <a href="https://shop.sja.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link items-center gap-2 underline-offset-4 focus-visible:text-contrast-five focus-visible:bg-bright-green focus:outline-none focus-visible:underline disabled:underline font-body [&amp;_svg]:!text-current [&amp;_svg]:!stroke-current has-[svg]:h-auto cursor-pointer text-contrast-five hover:text-contrast-five-light underline disabled:text-contrast-four active:text-primary-dark [&amp;_svg,&amp;_img]:-order-1 text-base [&amp;_svg]:!size-6 font-normal text-left inline ${richTextTextLinkHoverClass} rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-solid! focus-visible:outline-2! focus-visible:outline-offset-0! focus-visible:outline-black!">St John Ambulance shop</a>.</p><div><div data-link-item="true" class="block lg:inline-block mr-3 last:mr-0 mt-2 mb-2 align-top text-center"><a data-contentful-entry-id="7diMXG5009bYnaz3yUNJA3" href="https://shop.sja.org.uk/pages/courses" title="This is an external link. Clicking ere will open a different website in a new tab." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 focus-visible:bg-sec