p-2 focus-visible:bg-secondary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary focus-visible:text-contrast-five focus-visible:outline-offset-0 font-bold text-contrast-five tracking-wide font-body disabled:!bg-contrast-three disabled:!outline-none border-2 has-[svg]:h-auto transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform] motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-out motion-safe:[transform:translateZ(0)] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [backface-visibility:hidden] motion-reduce:transform-none cursor-pointer disabled:!border-contrast-three border-white bg-contrast-one rounded-[360px] hover:bg-off-white hover:border-off-white focus:border-primary [&amp;_svg,&amp;_img]:-order-1 h-12 px-3 text-base [&amp;_svg]:!size-6 has-[svg]:min-h-12 motion-safe:hover:scale-[1.05] motion-safe:focus-visible:scale-[1.05] motion-safe:active:scale-[1.02]"><span class="shrink-0 no-underline"><svg class="" style="color:currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8.66669 7.33337L14.1334 1.8667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.6667 4.53325V1.33325H11.4667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M7.33331 1.33325H5.99998C2.66665 1.33325 1.33331 2.66659 1.33331 5.99992V9.99992C1.33331 13.3333 2.66665 14.6666 5.99998 14.6666H9.99998C13.3333 14.6666 14.6666 13.3333 14.6666 9.99992V8.66659" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="">Shop first aid supplies</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><section data-contentful-entry-id="PN0JofHVbtNWj4JvwduZb" class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row-reverse overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><div class="bg-primary-dark text-off-white justify-center w-full md:w-[50%] flex flex-col items-flex-start px-4 py-6 md:p-10 flex-1"><h2 class="text-inherit text-lg/snug lg:text-2xl/tight font-bold mb-3">Gifts in Wills</h2><div data-contentful-field-id="text" class="prose prose-lg text-sm/tight lg:text-base/snug [&amp;_a]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:hover]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:active]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:focus-visible]:text-inherit!"><div class="rich-text-content [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><p class="mb-4 last:mb-0">An amazing 30% of our charitable funding comes from legacy gifts. When someone leaves a gift to us in their Will, they help us move towards our vision of a world where everyone is confident, ready, and able to respond whenever first aid is needed - saving more lives. </p></div></div><div data-contentful-field-id="links" class="mt-6 flex gap-4 justify-start items-center flex-wrap flex-row"><a data-contentful-entry-id="3Kh1CUSh0l4xgyUeKT4Akp" href="https://www.sja.org.uk/get-involved/legacy-giving/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 focus-visible:bg-secondary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary focus-visible:text-contrast-five focus-visible:outline-offset-0 font-bold text-contrast-five tracking-wide font-body disabled:!bg-contrast-three disabled:!outline-none border-2 has-[svg]:h-auto transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform] motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-out motion-safe:[transform:translateZ(0)] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [backface-visibility:hidden] motion-reduce:transform-none cursor-pointer disabled:!border-contrast-three bg-primary border-primary hover:bg-bright-green rounded-[360px] hover:border-bright-green active:bg-secondary [&amp;_svg,&amp;_img]:-order-1 h-12 px-3 text-base [&amp;_svg]:!size-6 has-[svg]:min-h-12 motion-safe:hover:scale-[1.05] motion-safe:focus-visible:scale-[1.05] motion-safe:active:scale-[1.02]"><span class="">Read more about legacy giving</span></a></div></div><div data-contentful-field-id="image" class="w-full md:w-[50%] flex"><div class="relative object-cover w-full h-auto"><picture class="block h-full w-full"><source srcSet="https://images