ass="text-sm mb-3 text-white">There are many ways to support our mission, and not all of them require picking up a first aid kit. Learn about gifts in wills, partnerships, donations and more.</p><span data-contentful-entry-id="4tVNZ8wrZ7Kxjcn4a0D242" class="link inline-flex items-center gap-2 underline-offset-4 focus-visible:text-contrast-five focus-visible:bg-bright-green focus:outline-none focus-visible:underline disabled:text-contrast-four disabled:underline font-body font-bold [&amp;_svg]:!text-current [&amp;_svg]:!stroke-current has-[svg]:h-auto text-center cursor-pointer text-white hover:text-bright-green hover:no-underline active:bg-primary-dark active:text-white [&amp;_svg,&amp;_img]:-order-1 text-base [&amp;_svg]:!size-6 no-underline link-underline-hide w-auto leading-5.5"><span class="">Find more ways to give</span></span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4 px-4" aria-hidden="true"><div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out" style="background:var(--Subheader, #020202)"></div><div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out" style="background:var(--Primary-Palette-Primary-Light, #ADD2B9)"></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block container mx-auto"><style>
