"relative z-10"><span data-contentful-field-id="heading" class="block font-bold text-2xl/[115%] mb-3 text-white">More ways to give</span><p data-contentful-field-id="text" class="text-sm mb-3 text-white">There are many ways to support our mission, and not all of them require picking up a first aid kit. Learn about gifts in wills, partnerships, donations and more.</p><span data-contentful-entry-id="4tVNZ8wrZ7Kxjcn4a0D242" class="link inline-flex items-center gap-2 underline-offset-4 focus-visible:text-contrast-five focus-visible:bg-bright-green focus:outline-none focus-visible:underline disabled:text-contrast-four disabled:underline font-body font-bold [&amp;_svg]:!text-current [&amp;_svg]:!stroke-current has-[svg]:h-auto text-center cursor-pointer text-white hover:text-bright-green hover:no-underline active:bg-primary-dark active:text-white [&amp;_svg,&amp;_img]:-order-1 text-base [&amp;_svg]:!size-6 no-underline link-underline-hide w-auto leading-5.5"><span class="">Find more ways to give</span></span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><section data-contentful-entry-id="3AHHZAOqY57z1HDp9mljnR" class="flex flex-col md:flex-row overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><div class="bg-primary-dark text-off-white justify-center w-full md:w-[50%] flex flex-col items-flex-start px-4 py-6 md:p-10 flex-1"><h2 class="text-inherit text-lg/snug lg:text-2xl/tight font-bold mb-3">Restart a Heart Day</h2><div data-contentful-field-id="text" class="prose prose-lg text-sm/tight lg:text-base/snug [&amp;_a]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:hover]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:active]:text-inherit! [&amp;_a:focus-visible]:text-inherit!"><div class="rich-text-content [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><p class="mb-4 last:mb-0">Each year on the 16 October, Restart a Heart Day gives you and everyone in your workplace, home, or school the opportunity to learn or refresh this life-saving skill. </p></div></div><div data-contentful-field-id="links" class="mt-6 flex gap-4 justify-start it